From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 09:03:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 112/112] Copy file path and Open containing folder in the
 tab's menu

The tab's right-click menu starts with Copy file path and Open
containing folder. Both act on the right-clicked tab, not the active
one, and are disabled for a tab without a file. Copy file path puts the
absolute path on the clipboard. Open containing folder asks the file
manager to show the file selected (org.freedesktop.FileManager1
ShowItems over D-Bus, through gio when built with gvfs) and opens the
folder with the default app when no file manager answers. Failures are
logged with the path.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

